  "description": "群里/私聊有人托话，记成工单送达主人；主人处理完，机器人自己找对工单回群引用原消息告诉本人",
  "type": "module",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "shangxueink",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "aurabot": {
    "displayName": "转告主人反馈",
    "panel": "./dist/panel.js",
    "category": "social",
    "capabilities": [
      "plugin-config",
      "filesystem",
      "network",
      "plugin-internals"
    ],
    "minPluginVersion": "2.0.0-beta.16",
    "api": 2,
    "platforms": [
      "*"
    ],
    "requires": [],
